        "TileImage": "$($repository 872ef621-7fe3-4ab3-80d5-f689a5bbd950).Image",
        "Description": "A number of Chit&apos;s Lieutenants have been spotted in the infamous Himmapan Hotel, congregating. These fudgers have been partaking in nefarious activities around the hotel, such as prostitution and the transaction of expired capital. They are a dangerous subbranch of the Church of Chit cult, and their motto is &quot;Fudge off or Chit will get it&quot;. We have to put a stop to their plots at once, dealing a crippling blow to the Chit. \rGo get it 47, the Chit awaits.",
